--- !u!114 &1522655441
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1522655439}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: f4688fdb7df04437aeb418b961361dc5, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.TextMeshPro::TMPro.TextMeshProUGUI
  m_Material: {fileID: 0}
  m_Color: {r: 1, g: 1, b: 1, a: 1}
  m_RaycastTarget: 0
  m_RaycastPadding: {x: 0, y: 0, z: 0, w: 0}
  m_Maskable: 1
  m_OnCullStateChanged:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "NO-LIMIT HOLD'EM \xB7 VIRTUAL CHIPS ONLY\nTwo private cards each, five
    public board cards. Best five of seven wins. Fold, check/call, or raise to a
    total. The button and blinds rotate, heads-up button is small blind and acts
    first before the flop; the big blind acts first afterward. Blinds grow every
    selected number of hands. Tournament ends when one seat holds all chips.\n\nYOUR
    CONTROLS\nLeft/right selects FOLD, CHECK/CALL or RAISE. Forward/back adjusts
    the raise total. Your assigned ACTION freshly confirms. MIN / HALF POT / POT
    / ALL IN presets select an amount; they never bet without confirmation. Only
    legal raises are accepted. A short all-in may not reopen raising; the panel explains
    why. Side pots, splits, odd chips left of the button and uncalled returns are
    automatic. No real money or online services.\n\nPRIVATE HANDS\nHold your shown
    PEEK key, whole-pad LEFT SHOULDER or the assigned shared-stick click. Release
    hides and clears that private display. Your own pane only; no private faces in
    the world, reflections, logs or replays. Pausing, focus loss, disconnects, folding
    and handoffs hide private cards. Hot seat requires a fresh handoff confirmation
    before peeking. Ordinary showdown shows required winners; all-in showdown shows
    surviving hands. Local split-screen cannot prevent someone physically looking
    at your pane.\n\nCAB LOOK\nWhole-pad right stick, or hold right mouse for the
    one keyboard participant assigned the mouse. Middle mouse / whole-pad right-stick
    click recenters. Separate shared sticks keep fixed useful views. Look never drives
    or bets. Camera sensitivity/invert are configurable. Public expressions react
    to actions/results, never hidden hand strength. AI sees only its own hand and
    public information. Offline names/colors/sources and setup persist through rematches."
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: be1034cebd9fa3643a48d11ef76e4708, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: -7304394381272760782, guid: 8e8f97682e668e94cb30d2e6b8e13d84,
